[?2004l[?2004h[01;32manalyst@adc532b5a88c[00m:[01;34m/app[00m$ cat << 'EOF' > /app/submission/README.md
[?2004l[?2004h> # Incident Review
[?2004l[?2004h> Two malicious sources (src-d734686e and src-4e2d7f55) injected fake plugin catalog data and fallback endpoints, generating tainted memories. This caused the archive publisher plugin to be misconfigured and an action to exfiltrate credentials to an external drop. The sources and memories were quarantined, the malicious action cancelled, and the exposed credential rotated. The plugin and queued legitimate actions were repaired and bound to the new credential. The boundary policy was updated to deny unauthorized hosts and credential forwarding.
[?2004l[?2004h> EOF
[?2004l[?2004h[01;32manalyst@adc532b5a88c[00m:[01;34m/app[00m$ 